<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 20-DEC.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 20-DEC.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Orphelia has dissipated and is no longer a threat to shipping.  </p>
<p>Tropical Depression 41W is a minor threat to shipping in the southern South China Sea. The depression has 30 mph winds and is centered near 5n/108e. The system is nearly stationary. It should dissipate over open waters this period.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS</p>
</text>
